<article class="env-definition" id="030G">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/030G">Definition <span data-tag="030G">9.26.4</span>.</a> Let $K/k$ be a field extension. The <em>transcendence degree</em> of $K$ over $k$ is the cardinality of a transcendence basis of $K$ over $k$. It is denoted $\text{trdeg}_ k(K)$. </p>
